sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Tablet map (Raft)
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant O as N1 (leaving replica)
  participant N as N4 (destination)
  M->>C: transition: write both, read old
  par protect incoming writes
    C->>O: new mutation
    C->>N: same mutation
  and transfer existing data
    O->>N: stream tablet data
  end
  Note over C,N: destination ready, transition barriers complete
  M->>C: transition: write both, read new
  C->>N: read tablet 17
  M->>C: transition: use new replica set
  C->>N: reads and writes
  M->>O: cleanup leaving tablet copy
  Note over M,N: Simplified - other RF replicas and barriers hidden
